{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2021-08-04 18:14:00', 'title': 'MRM NAMED BY FAST COMPANY AS ONE OF THE 100 BEST PLACES TO WORK FOR INNOVATORS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, AUG. 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MRM, THE LEADING MARKETING AGENCY THAT IS PART OF MCCANN WORLDGROUP, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO FAST COMPANY\'S THIRD ANNUAL LIST OF THE 100 BEST PLACES TO WORK FOR INNOVATORS. FAST COMPANY WROTE THAT THE ORGANIZATIONS, LEADERS AND TEAMS IT SELECTED HAS CREATED CULTURES OF INNOVATION BECAUSE\xa0 THEY "FOUND WAYS TO COLLABORATE AND INVENT DESPITE THE CHALLENGES POSED BY THE PANDEMIC, AND IN SOME CASES APPLIED THEIR INNOVATION PROWESS TO THE CHALLENGES OF VIRTUAL WORK.'}